      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Investment Operations and Middle Office Analyst with experience supporting Fixed Income, Cash Bonds, OTC Derivatives, Equity Swaps and global trade lifecycle operations. Skilled in exception monitoring, investigation and resolution of operational breaks, data validation, reconciliation, root cause analysis and control reporting. Experienced in analysing trade data, investigating discrepancies, managing workflow exceptions and coordinating with Operations, Technology, Trading, Sales, Documentation teams, custodians and external stakeholders to ensure timely resolution of operational issues. Strong understanding of financial products, post-trade processes, operational controls, reporting and risk management frameworks.",
